    "topic": "Structural Fit-up",
    "granularity": "Heuristic",
    "title": "Alternate tack sequence controls pull",
    "content": "On long steel frames, tack opposite ends and alternate sides before full welding. Re-check diagonals after each tack pass; if the frame pulls, adjust the next tack before adding more heat.",
